<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>MY RETRO by Vizmind Motorcycle - Penyetelan dan Perawatan Berkala Yamaha XSR 155</title>
    <!-- Google Fonts: Oswald (Maskulin/Industrial) & Space Grotesk -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Oswald:wght@500;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-dark: #0A0A0A;
            --bg-card: #141414;
            --bg-row-alt: #111111;
            --bg-row-hover: #1E1E1E;
            --text-white: #FFFFFF;
            --text-gray: #B3B3B3;
            --text-muted: #555555;
            --accent-yellow: #FFD100;
            --accent-yellow-dim: rgba(255, 209, 0, 0.14);
            --accent-yellow-glow: rgba(255, 209, 0, 0.24);
            --danger-red: #FF3B30;
            --border-color: #2A2A2A;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-dark);
            color: var(--text-white);
            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.55;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* Typography Maskulin */
        h1, h2, h3, .badge, .nav-btn, .km-filter-btn, th {
            font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        }

        /* Header / Hero Section */
        header {
            border-bottom: 3px solid var(--accent-yellow);
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #111111 0%, #050505 100%);
            padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
            position: relative;
        }

        .header-container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .tag-line {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: var(--accent-yellow);
            color: #000000;
            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 0.3rem 0.9rem;
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 96% 100%, 0% 100%);
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 5vw, 3.8rem);
            line-height: 1.08;
            color: var(--text-white);
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }

        header h1 span {
            display: block;
            color: var(--accent-yellow);
        }

        header p {
            color: var(--text-gray);
            max-width: 760px;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        /* Navigation Filter Tabs */
        nav {
            background-color: #111111;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
            padding: 0.7rem 1.5rem;
        }

        .nav-container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            gap: 0.55rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .nav-btn {
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--text-white);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 0.45rem 1rem;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .nav-btn:hover, .nav-btn.active {
            background-color: var(--accent-yellow);
            color: #000000;
            border-color: var(--accent-yellow);
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        /* Main Content */
        main {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 2rem auto;
            padding: 0 1.5rem;
        }

        .section-block {
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .section-title {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.75rem;
            font-size: 1.65rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.15rem;
            border-left: 5px solid var(--accent-yellow);
            padding-left: 0.85rem;
        }

        .badge {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            padding: 0.22rem 0.55rem;
            background: var(--accent-yellow-dim);
            color: var(--accent-yellow);
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-yellow);
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        /* Notes Box (Catatan Penting) */
        .notes-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .note-card {
            background-color: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-top: 3px solid var(--accent-yellow);
            padding: 1.15rem;
        }

        .note-card h3 {
            color: var(--accent-yellow);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
        }

        .note-card p, .note-card li {
            color: var(--text-gray);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .note-card ul {
            padding-left: 1.15rem;
            margin-top: 0.35rem;
        }

        .note-card strong {
            color: var(--text-white);
        }

        /* Interactive Interval Highlighter Bar */
        .km-bar {
            background-color: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.75rem;
        }

        .km-bar-label {
            font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: var(--accent-yellow);
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        }

        .km-filter-group {
            display: flex;
            gap: 0.45rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .km-filter-btn {
            background-color: #0A0A0A;
            color: var(--text-white);
            border: 1px solid #333;
            padding: 0.38rem 0.8rem;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .km-filter-btn:hover, .km-filter-btn.active-col {
            background-color: var(--accent-yellow);
            color: #000000;
            border-color: var(--accent-yellow);
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        /* Responsive Table Styling */
        .table-wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            overflow-x: auto;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            background-color: var(--bg-card);
        }

        .table-wrapper::-webkit-scrollbar {
            height: 8px;
        }

        .table-wrapper::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #0A0A0A;
        }

        .table-wrapper::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: var(--accent-yellow);
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            min-width: 860px;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            text-align: left;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        thead th {
            background-color: #1A1A1A;
            color: var(--accent-yellow);
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent-yellow);
            border-right: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 0.85rem 0.75rem;
            font-size: 0.92rem;
            line-height: 1.25;
            vertical-align: middle;
        }

        thead th.center {
            text-align: center;
        }

        tbody td {
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-right: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--text-gray);
            vertical-align: middle;
        }

        tbody tr:nth-child(even) {
            background-color: var(--bg-row-alt);
        }

        tbody tr:hover {
            background-color: var(--bg-row-hover);
        }

        td.num-col {
            text-align: center;
            font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-white);
            width: 48px;
        }

        td.item-col {
            color: var(--text-white);
            font-weight: 600;
            min-width: 210px;
        }

        td.item-col em {
            display: block;
            font-weight: 400;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            color: var(--text-gray);
        }

        .star {
            color: var(--accent-yellow);
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-right: 2px;
        }

        td.task-col {
            min-width: 260px;
        }

        td.task-col strong {
            color: var(--text-white);
        }

        td.check-col {
            text-align: center;
            width: 95px;
            font-weight: 700;
            transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
        }

        .check-mark {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            width: 26px;
            height: 26px;
            background-color: var(--accent-yellow-dim);
            color: var(--accent-yellow);
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-yellow);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .dash-mark {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        td.span-interval {
            text-align: center;
            background-color: var(--accent-yellow-dim);
            color: var(--accent-yellow);
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        }

        /* Highlighted Column State */
        th.col-highlighted {
            background-color: var(--accent-yellow) !important;
            color: #000000 !important;
        }

        td.col-highlighted {
            background-color: var(--accent-yellow-glow) !important;
        }

        .scroll-hint {
            display: none;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--accent-yellow);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .scroll-hint {
                display: block;
            }
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--text-gray);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-top: 3.5rem;
        }

        footer span {
            color: var(--accent-yellow);
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .hidden {
            display: none !important;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="header-container">
            <div class="tag-line">MY RETRO by Vizmind Motorcycle</div>
            <h1>PENYETELAN DAN PERAWATAN BERKALA <span>YAMAHA XSR 155</span></h1>
            <p>Tabel Jadwal Perawatan Sistem Kontrol Emisi &amp; Perawatan Umum (Halaman 7-2 – 7-7) berdasarkan Manual Book Resmi Yamaha XSR 155.</p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <div class="nav-container">
            <button class="nav-btn active" onclick="filterSection('all', this)">Semua Tabel</button>
            <button class="nav-btn" onclick="filterSection('emisi', this)">1. Sistem Kontrol Emisi (7-2 – 7-3)</button>
            <button class="nav-btn" onclick="filterSection('umum', this)">2. Perawatan Umum &amp; Pelumasan (7-4 – 7-7)</button>
            <button class="nav-btn" onclick="filterSection('catatan', this)">Catatan Penting</button>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main>
        <!-- CATATAN PENTING AWAL (HALAMAN 7-2) -->
        <section class="section-block" data-category="catatan">
            <h2 class="section-title">
                <span>Catatan Penting Jadwal Perawatan</span>
                <span class="badge">HAL. 7-2</span>
            </h2>
            <div class="notes-grid">
                <div class="note-card">
                    <h3>Patokan Interval Servis</h3>
                    <p>Perawatan dilakukan berdasarkan pembacaan odometer (kilometer) atau waktu tempuh—<strong>mana yang tercapai lebih dulu</strong>.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="note-card">
                    <h3>Pemeriksaan Tahunan</h3>
                    <p><strong>Annual Check</strong> wajib dilakukan setiap tahun, kecuali jika perawatan berbasis jarak tempuh sudah dilakukan lebih dulu.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="note-card">
                    <h3>Setelah 20.000 km</h3>
                    <p>Setelah melewati jarak tempuh 20.000 km, ulangi siklus interval perawatan mulai dari kolom <strong>4.000 km</strong>.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="note-card">
                    <h3>Tanda Bintang (<span class="star">*</span>)</h3>
                    <p>Komponen bertanda <strong>*</strong> sebaiknya dikerjakan oleh <strong>dealer Yamaha</strong> karena memerlukan peralatan khusus, data teknis, dan keahlian tertentu.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- BAR SOROT INTERVAL KILOMETER -->
        <div class="km-bar" id="km-highlighter">
            <div class="km-bar-label">SOROT KOLOM JADWAL SERVIS:</div>
            <div class="km-filter-group">
                <button class="km-filter-btn active-col" onclick="highlightCol(0, this)">Normal</button>
                <button class="km-filter-btn" onclick="highlightCol(1, this)">1.000 km</button>
                <button class="km-filter-btn" onclick="highlightCol(2, this)">4.000 km</button>
                <button class="km-filter-btn" onclick="highlightCol(3, this)">8.000 km</button>
                <button class="km-filter-btn" onclick="highlightCol(4, this)">12.000 km</button>
                <button class="km-filter-btn" onclick="highlightCol(5, this)">16.000 km</button>
                <button class="km-filter-btn" onclick="highlightCol(6, this)">Tahunan</button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- TABEL 1: SISTEM KONTROL EMISI (HALAMAN 7-2 – 7-3) -->
        <section class="section-block" data-category="emisi">
            <h2 class="section-title">
                <span>1. Tabel Perawatan Berkala untuk Sistem Kontrol Emisi</span>
                <span class="badge">HAL. 7-2 – 7-3</span>
            </h2>
            <p class="scroll-hint">&larr; Geser tabel ke kanan/kiri untuk melihat seluruh kolom kilometer &rarr;</p>
            <div class="table-wrapper">
                <table>
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th class="center">No.</th>
                            <th>Komponen (Item)</th>
                            <th>Pemeriksaan atau Pekerjaan Perawatan</th>
                            <th class="center" data-col="1">1.000 km<br>(2 bln)</th>
                            <th class="center" data-col="2">4.000 km<br>(6 bln)</th>
                            <th class="center" data-col="3">8.000 km<br>(10 bln)</th>
                            <th class="center" data-col="4">12.000 km<br>(14 bln)</th>
                            <th class="center" data-col="5">16.000 km<br>(18 bln)</th>
                            <th class="center" data-col="6">Pemeriksaan<br>Tahunan</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="num-col">1</td>
                            <td class="item-col"><span class="star">*</span> Saluran bahan bakar <em>Fuel line</em></td>
                            <td class="task-col">Periksa selang bahan bakar dari keretakan atau kerusakan.</td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="1"><span class="dash-mark">—</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="2"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="3"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="4"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="5"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="6"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="num-col">2</td>
                            <td class="item-col"><span class="star">*</span> Filter bahan bakar <em>Fuel filter</em></td>
                            <td class="task-col">Periksa kondisi; ganti jika perlu.</td>
                            <td colspan="6" class="span-interval">Setiap 12.000 km (7.500 mil)</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="num-col" rowspan="2">3</td>
                            <td class="item-col" rowspan="2"><span class="star">*</span> Busi <em>Spark plug</em></td>
                            <td class="task-col">Periksa kondisi; bersihkan dan setel ulang celah busi.</td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="1"><span class="dash-mark">—</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="2"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="3"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="4"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="5"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="6"><span class="dash-mark">—</span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="task-col"><strong>Ganti busi.</strong></td>
                            <td colspan="6" class="span-interval">Setiap 8.000 km (5.000 mil)</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="num-col">4</td>
                            <td class="item-col"><span class="star">*</span> Katup / Klep <em>Valves</em></td>
                            <td class="task-col">Periksa celah katup; setel jika perlu.</td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="1"><span class="dash-mark">—</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="2"><span class="dash-mark">—</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="3"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="4"><span class="dash-mark">—</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="5"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="6"><span class="dash-mark">—</span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="num-col">5</td>
                            <td class="item-col"><span class="star">*</span> Injeksi bahan bakar <em>Fuel injection</em></td>
                            <td class="task-col">Setel putaran stasioner (<em>idling</em>) mesin.</td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="1"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="2"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="3"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="4"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="5"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="6"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="num-col">6</td>
                            <td class="item-col"><span class="star">*</span> Sistem pembuangan <em>Exhaust system</em></td>
                            <td class="task-col">Periksa kebocoran; kencangkan jika perlu; ganti gasket jika perlu.</td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="1"><span class="dash-mark">—</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="2"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="3"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="4"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="5"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="6"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="num-col">7</td>
                            <td class="item-col"><span class="star">*</span> Sistem kontrol emisi evaporatif <em>Evaporative emission control system</em></td>
                            <td class="task-col">Periksa sistem kontrol dari kerusakan; ganti jika perlu.</td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="1"><span class="dash-mark">—</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="2"><span class="dash-mark">—</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="3"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="4"><span class="dash-mark">—</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="5"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="6"><span class="dash-mark">—</span></td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- TABEL 2: PERAWATAN UMUM DAN PELUMASAN (HALAMAN 7-4 – 7-7) -->
        <section class="section-block" data-category="umum">
            <h2 class="section-title">
                <span>2. Tabel Perawatan Umum dan Pelumasan</span>
                <span class="badge">HAL. 7-4 – 7-7</span>
            </h2>
            <p class="scroll-hint">&larr; Geser tabel ke kanan/kiri untuk melihat seluruh kolom kilometer &rarr;</p>
            <div class="table-wrapper">
                <table>
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th class="center">No.</th>
                            <th>Komponen (Item)</th>
                            <th>Pemeriksaan atau Pekerjaan Perawatan</th>
                            <th class="center" data-col="1">1.000 km<br>(2 bln)</th>
                            <th class="center" data-col="2">4.000 km<br>(6 bln)</th>
                            <th class="center" data-col="3">8.000 km<br>(10 bln)</th>
                            <th class="center" data-col="4">12.000 km<br>(14 bln)</th>
                            <th class="center" data-col="5">16.000 km<br>(18 bln)</th>
                            <th class="center" data-col="6">Pemeriksaan<br>Tahunan</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="num-col">1</td>
                            <td class="item-col"><span class="star">*</span> Pemeriksaan sistem diagnostik <em>Diagnostic system check</em></td>
                            <td class="task-col">Lakukan inspeksi dinamis menggunakan alat diagnostik Yamaha; periksa kode error.</td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="1"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="2"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="3"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="4"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="5"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="6"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="num-col" rowspan="2">2</td>
                            <td class="item-col" rowspan="2"><span class="star">*</span> Elemen filter udara <em>Air filter element</em></td>
                            <td class="task-col">Bersihkan.</td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="1"><span class="dash-mark">—</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="2"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
                            <td class="check-col" data-col="3"><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span></td>
